#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:38
msgid "1. Declaring and defining variables"
msgstr "1. Деклариране и дефиниране на variables"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:40
msgid "A **variable** is a name for a value in memory. Creating it has two parts:"
msgstr "**Variable** е име за стойност в паметта. Създаването ѝ има две части:"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:42
msgid "**declaring** - telling JavaScript the name: `let serial;`"
msgstr "**деклариране** - казваме на JavaScript името: `let serial;`"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:43
msgid "**defining** (initialising) - giving it its first value: `serial = \"SN4X7Q92\";`"
msgstr "**дефиниране** (инициализиране) - даваме ѝ първата стойност: `serial = \"SN4X7Q92\";`"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:45
msgid "Usually we do both at once:"
msgstr "Обикновено правим двете наведнъж:"

