#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:58 site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:198 site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:292 site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:337
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Анимации"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:59
msgid "**Variables in memory:** [1. Declaring and assigning](../animations/variablesInMemory.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Copying a value](../animations/variablesInMemory.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**Variables в паметта:** [1. Деклариране и присвояване](../animations/variablesInMemory.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Копиране на стойност](../animations/variablesInMemory.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. heading 3
