msgid "Write comments that explain **why**, not what: `// rule guidelines require const globals` is useful; `// set x to 5` is not."
msgstr "Пишете коментари, които обясняват **защо**, а не какво: `// rule guidelines require const globals` е полезен; `// set x to 5` не е."

