#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:321
msgid "Precedence"
msgstr "Приоритет"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:323
msgid "As in math: `**` first, then `*` `/` `%`, then `+` `-`. Use parentheses when in doubt:"
msgstr "Както в математиката: първо `**`, после `*` `/` `%`, после `+` `-`. Когато се колебаете, слагайте скоби:"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:331
msgid "**Check yourself:** what does `10 + 20 / 10 * 2 ** 2` print?"
msgstr "**Проверете се:** какво извежда `10 + 20 / 10 * 2 ** 2`?"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/02-variables-and-types.md:334
msgid "`18`: first `2 ** 2 = 4`, then `20 / 10 = 2`, `2 * 4 = 8`, then `10 + 8`."
msgstr "`18`: първо `2 ** 2 = 4`, после `20 / 10 = 2`, `2 * 4 = 8`, после `10 + 8`."

